# A station's page on the desktop (sfdesk station_page.mbt, the web's cloud/StationPage.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over
# the made-up chat. Station from the rail (its first station's page); its parts: 设置, 软件与设备, back to 概览.
timeout 30000
until 发消息
wait 600
tapxy 27 157
wait 1500
tap =设置
wait 1500
tap 软件与设备
wait 1500
tap 概览
wait 1200
exit
